{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"創世記","commonName":"創世記","title":"創世記","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"1404fb057bc5d112b6346816325dee0ee8a74030ba18767f6f29f0e588eca9ab","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1531},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["洪水氾濫"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對挪亞說：「你和你全家都進入方舟，因為這個世代只有你在我眼中是義人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["潔淨的動物，你要每樣帶七公七母，不潔淨的動物每樣帶一公一母，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["飛鳥每樣帶七公七母，叫牠們以後可以在地上繁衍後代。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為七天之後，我要在地上降雨四十晝夜，從地上毀滅我所造的一切活物。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["凡耶和華所吩咐的，挪亞都照辦了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["洪水在大地上氾濫那年，挪亞六百歲了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["挪亞與妻子、兒子們和兒媳們都進了方舟，躲避洪水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["潔淨的動物、不潔淨的動物、飛禽和地上的一切爬蟲，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["都一公一母成對地到挪亞那裡，進了方舟，正如上帝對挪亞的吩咐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["七天過後，洪水在地上氾濫起來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["挪亞六百歲那年的二月",{"noteId":6},"十七日，所有深淵的泉源都裂開了，天上的水閘也打開了，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["地上大雨降了四十晝夜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["就在那天，挪亞與他的兒子閃、含和雅弗，還有挪亞的妻子和三個兒媳婦都進了方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["所有的野獸、牲畜、地上的爬蟲和飛鳥，都按種類進入方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["一切有生命氣息的活物都成對地到挪亞那裡，進入方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["所有進入方舟的動物都是一公一母，正如上帝對挪亞的吩咐。然後，耶和華關上了方舟的門。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["洪水在地上氾濫了四十天，水不斷往上漲，把方舟漂了起來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["洪水來勢洶洶，淹沒大地，方舟漂浮在水面上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["水勢越來越大，把天下各處的高山都淹沒了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["水淹沒了群山，高出群山七米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["地上所有的飛禽、走獸、牲畜、爬蟲等動物和人類都死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["陸地上所有鼻孔有生命氣息的活物都死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["地上的人類、飛禽走獸和爬蟲等一切活物都被毀滅了，只剩下挪亞和跟他同在方舟裡的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["洪水淹沒大地一百五十天。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"「二月」按猶太曆計算，本卷書所用月份都是按猶太曆計算。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/GEN/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}